<import src="../../components/states.wxml"/><view class="page"><template is="feedback" data="{{loading,error}}"/><view class="heading">AI模拟服务配置</view><view class="notice warn section">仅本地模拟，配置立即影响消费者入口。禁止输入真实支付凭据或AI密钥。管理员权限由服务层校验。</view><view class="card section"><view class="row config-row"><text>开启AI文本计划</text><switch checked="{{config.textEnabled}}" data-key="textEnabled" bindchange="toggle"/></view><view class="row config-row"><text>开启模拟识餐</text><switch checked="{{config.photoEnabled}}" data-key="photoEnabled" bindchange="toggle"/></view><view class="config-row">调用超时秒数<input type="number" value="{{config.timeout}}" data-key="timeout" data-number="true" bindinput="input"/></view><view class="config-row">最大token<input type="number" value="{{config.maxTokens}}" data-key="maxTokens" data-number="true" bindinput="input"/></view><view class="config-row">全局每日调用上限<input type="number" value="{{config.dailyLimit}}" data-key="dailyLimit" data-number="true" bindinput="input"/></view><view class="config-row">后续新账号免费次数<input type="number" value="{{config.initialFree}}" data-key="initialFree" data-number="true" bindinput="input"/></view><view class="config-row">最长计划天数<input type="number" value="{{config.maxDays}}" data-key="maxDays" data-number="true" bindinput="input"/></view><view class="config-row">最低参考热量（1500–2500）<input type="number" value="{{config.minIntake}}" data-key="minIntake" data-number="true" bindinput="input"/></view><view class="config-row">最大情景缺口（0–500）<input type="number" value="{{config.maxDeficit}}" data-key="maxDeficit" data-number="true" bindinput="input"/></view><view class="config-row">每周情景上限kg（不超过0.9）<input type="digit" value="{{config.maxWeekly}}" data-key="maxWeekly" data-number="true" bindinput="input"/></view><view class="config-row">演示服务商名称<input type="text" value="{{config.provider}}" data-key="provider"  bindinput="input"/></view><view class="config-row">输出规则<input type="text" value="{{config.rules}}" data-key="rules"  bindinput="input"/></view><button class="btn mt" bindtap="save" disabled="{{busy}}" loading="{{busy}}">保存生效</button></view><view class="card section"><view class="title">最近调用日志</view><button class="btn white mt" bindtap="exportLogs">导出调用日志Excel</button><view wx:for="{{logs}}" wx:key="id" class="config-row"><view>{{item.type}} · {{statusLabels[item.status] || item.status}} · {{item.day}}</view><view class="caption mt">{{item.source}} · {{item.provider}} · {{item.cost}}次</view></view></view><view class="card section"><view class="title">服务商与模型（仅模拟）</view><block wx:for="{{providers}}" wx:key="id"><view wx:if="{{!item.deleted}}" class="config-row"><view class="title">{{item.name}} {{config.active === item.id ? "· 当前主服务商" : ""}}</view><view class="caption mt">文本 {{item.textModel}} / 图片 {{item.imageModel}}</view><view class="actions mt"><button size="mini" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="activate">设为主服务商（保存生效）</button><button size="mini" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="editProvider">编辑</button><button size="mini" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="removeProvider" disabled="{{config.active === item.id}}">删除</button></view></view></block><button class="btn white mt" bindtap="newProvider">新建演示服务商</button><view class="config-row">名称<input value="{{providerForm.name}}" data-key="name" bindinput="providerInput"/></view><view class="config-row">文本HTTPS地址<input value="{{providerForm.textUrl}}" data-key="textUrl" bindinput="providerInput"/></view><view class="config-row">图片HTTPS地址<input value="{{providerForm.imageUrl}}" data-key="imageUrl" bindinput="providerInput"/></view><view class="config-row">文本模型<input value="{{providerForm.textModel}}" data-key="textModel" bindinput="providerInput"/></view><view class="config-row">图片模型<input value="{{providerForm.imageModel}}" data-key="imageModel" bindinput="providerInput"/></view><view class="notice mt">密钥仅使用内置DEMO_ONLY占位符；从不发送外部请求。</view><button class="btn mt" bindtap="saveProvider" disabled="{{busy}}">保存演示服务商</button></view></view>